Cell["\<\
This is experimental: shift back from averages and anti-averages to \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]0,1\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] notation. This also gives \
a simple matrix, but no real interpretation any more.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.970226690001008*^9, 3.97022672524946*^9}, {
